    "featuredImage": "https://marketing2student.com/wp-content/uploads/Khi-nao-nguoi-tieu-dung-quyet-dinh-doi-diem-thuong-Vai-tro-cua-thiet-ke-chuong-trinh-khach-hang-than-thiet.webp",
