    "featuredImage": "https://marketing2student.com/wp-content/uploads/Giua-luc-thue-quan-tang-cao-cac-nha-Marketing-tim-den-cac-giai-phap-AI-de-tang-cuong-suc-sang-tao.jpg",
    "publishedAt": "2025-04-22",
